      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test file, focusing on: removing unused imports, more descriptive variable names, and clarifying comments that explain the mutation-guard pattern.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed unused imports (`HashMap`, `HashSet`, `Document`, `Jsoup`, `NamespaceSvg`), renamed `imgOpts`/`inputOpts` to `imgOptionsSnapshot`/`inputOptionsSnapshot` to clarify their purpose as pre-call snapshots, added assertion messages explaining each check, and added Javadoc comments on both methods to explain the intent — including why the mutation guard exists (regression for issue #2323)."
